* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.parquet binary
*.woff2 binary
# The demo (and apps.json) is built by scripts/build_demos.py, and a test compares it byte for byte with a fresh build,
# so git must never rewrite a line ending in it (review.csv is CRLF on purpose).
skeleton/web/public/demo/** -text
skeleton/web/public/apps.json -text
skeleton/web/public/demo/*.json linguist-generated
skeleton/web/package-lock.json linguist-generated
uv.lock linguist-generated
docs/figures/*.html linguist-documentation
